WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
good morning

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:02,820
But how many times have you said that?

3
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,690
Get up and change into pajamas first, Dad

4
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:07,290
what are you doing

5
00:00:07,490 --> 00:00:08,890
Your nanny sister came last night

6
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:09,890
Your mother misses you

7
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,290
I’m going to lend you a loan to play with for two days.

8
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:13,290
But Yu Yu doesn’t want to go back

9
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:17,130
Yu Yu has a mission when she goes back

10
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,300
Dad can take care of himself

11
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,700
But your mother is a fool and you are not here

12
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,400
She must have stayed up late and not eaten properly

13
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,980
So Yu Yu has to go back and supervise her mother

14
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,780
Let her go to bed early and eat on time

15
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:30,380
Can you complete the task if you don't always work until midnight?

16
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,600
Yu Yu will definitely supervise her mother

17
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,400
Wait until mom gets better

18
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,150
Yu Yu came back and said, "This is my daughter."

19
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:41,550
Dad will take you out to play for a day today
